<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100179" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπ-αίρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>raise</i> or <i>lift at the same time</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					7.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πρόσθια σκέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					576b27
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>swell at the same time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).266
			</span></i>; <i>to be elevated together</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ
				λέξις τῷ μεγέθει τῶν λεγομένων ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				45
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				209
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>urge on together</i> or <i>also</i>, c. inf.,
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				8.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Oec.</u>
				5.5
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>rise together with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς
				δημαγωγοῖς</span>, of the rabble, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cor.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i><i>BJ Prooem.</i><i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπαιρομένου σὺν τῷ αἵματι καὶ τοῦ
				μοχθηροῦ χυμοῦ</span>
			<i>being carried to</i> (the foetus) with the blood, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.22
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
